--frontend / --no-frontend  Include the Vue frontend starter (default: false)
--environments <list>       Comma-separated environments (default:
                            dev,staging,prod)
--config <file>             Load deterministic project options from JSON

Framework options
─────────────────
Option                                Description
────────────────────────────────────  ──────────────────────────────────────────
--spec <framework>                    Spec-driven framework (default: openspec)
--agents <list>                       Comma-separated AI coding agents (default:
                                      copilot)
--default-agent <agent>               Primary agent for Spec Kit when multiple
                                      agents are selected
--governance <profile>                Repository-governance profile (default:
                                      single-maintainer-gitflow)
--copilot-cloud / --no-copilot-cloud  Set up the GitHub-hosted Copilot coding
