                              profile
--yes                         Accept project defaults and plan confirmation
--force                       Authorize replacement of listed regular-file
                              conflicts
--install-tools               Authorize allowlisted workstation tool
                              installation
--install-dependencies        Authorize project-local dependency installation

General options
───────────────
Option  Description
──────  ──────────────────────────
--help  Show command-specific help

"
`;

